{"Raëlian":{"id":"de73a7f1-ae71-4f54-a9b6-c72e49a11a0d","word":"Raëlian","trans":[{"lang":"Portuguese","code":"pt","lang_code":"pt","sense":"a member of Raëlism","tags":["masculine"],"word":"raelianismo"}],"pos":"noun","tags":null,"senses":[{"links":[["Raëlism","Raëlism"]],"glosses":["A member of the Raëlism movement."],"id":"8eaf26dc-7dfd-4b54-a353-0649645386a5"}],"related":[],"synonyms":[]},"Raëlism":{"id":"5d00d289-2409-4393-aa26-11dbb5a7bf8a","word":"Raëlism","trans":[{"lang":"Portuguese","code":"pt","lang_code":"pt","sense":"religion with liberal sexual views","tags":["masculine"],"word":"raelismo"},{"lang":"Portuguese","code":"pt","lang_code":"pt","sense":"religion with liberal sexual views","tags":["masculine"],"word":"raelianismo"}],"pos":"name","tags":null,"senses":[{"examples":[{"text":"Raëlism differs from Deistic Christianity.","ref":"2001, Twonky, “Which one? (WARNING God stuff)”, in alt.paranormal.crop-circles (Usenet):","type":"quotation","bold_text_offsets":[[0,7]],"id":"5e7f30b9-8fb7-43cd-a10e-eeed170caf6b"},{"text":"In fact, it is only size itself that separates Raëlism from Christianity or any other accepted religion. Absurdity of beliefs clearly doesn't distinguish a cult.","ref":"2003, Boris Ryser, “Relians^([sic]).... Things that are not believable”, in alt.religion.raelian (Usenet):","type":"quotation","bold_text_offsets":[[47,54]],"id":"2ee8d704-1581-448b-8fc8-5f708d7054e9"},{"text":"In December 2002, Clonaid, the medical arm of a religion called Raëlism, who believe that aliens introduced human life on Earth, claimed to have successfully cloned a human being.","ref":"2010, Savasan Yurtsever, Psalms Code, page 61:","type":"quotation","bold_text_offsets":[[64,71]],"id":"59216304-a0bc-42c0-a9d1-403e19b9c8f4"}],"links":[["UFO religion","UFO religion"],["liberal","liberal"],["sexual","sexual"],["life","life"],["Earth","Earth"],["scientific","scientific"],["laboratories","laboratory"],["extraterrestrial","extraterrestrial"]],"synonyms":[{"word":"Raelianism"}],"hypernyms":[{"word":"UFO religion"}],"categories":["English entries with incorrect language header","English eponyms","English lemmas","English proper nouns","English terms spelled with Ë","English terms spelled with ◌̈","English terms suffixed with -ism","English terms with quotations","English uncountable nouns","Entries with translation boxes","Pages with 1 entry","Pages with entries","Quotation templates to be cleaned","Terms with Esperanto translations","Terms with Finnish translations","Terms with French translations","Terms with Hebrew translations","Terms with Mandarin translations","Terms with Marathi translations","Terms with Polish translations","Terms with Portuguese translations","Terms with Russian translations","en:Raëlism","en:Religion"],"glosses":["A UFO religion with liberal sexual views, holding that all life on Earth was created in scientific laboratories by extraterrestrials."],"wikipedia":["Claude Vorilhon"],"id":"73fbb91e-4ce7-433c-b0ba-b71571b14076"}],"related":[{"word":"Raëlian"}],"synonyms":[]}}
